Package: snapok
Version: @VERSION@
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: ThinkAny <support@snapok.app>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, python3-pil, python3-numpy, python3-opencv, libsecret-tools
Recommends: tesseract-ocr, xdg-desktop-portal
Description: Screenshot capture, annotation, and organization for Ubuntu
 Snapok captures screen regions, annotates and frames images, creates scrolling
 screenshots on X11, keeps an editable history, and supports OCR and configurable
 OpenAI-compatible image assistance.
